 ],
 "comments": [
  {
   "address": 16384,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The vault's entry (module 7): screen off, raster lines for PAL or NTSC, the KERNAL switched out ($01 = $05) with NMI and IRQ vectors in RAM, then copies the picture: screen colours $B740 to $C000, colour RAM $BB28 to $D800, and the bitmap $9800-$B6FF to $E000"
  },
  {
   "address": 16513,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sets parts of the screen and bitmap the copy leaves, the sprites' colours, single colour and unexpanded, VIC bank 3 (screen $C000, bitmap $E000), the background from gym_bg, and the number of vaulters: the players, or 8 in practice"
  },
  {
   "address": 16658,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The interrupt on line $FB through $FFFE to gym_irq, bitmap mode on, row 24 of the screen colours set to white on black for the text line, the sprite data areas cleared"
  },
  {
   "address": 16752,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Each vault: sprites off, pointers $10-$15, the gymnast at X $19 and Y $AE in frame 0, run speed 3. On the second vault of a turn straight to the run"
  },
  {
   "address": 16846,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Practice: prints \"SCORE:\" and its value"
  },
  {
   "address": 16874,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Competition: writes the last gymnast's total into the record, then takes the next player down; after the first the event ends with \"PUSH BUTTON TO CONTINUE\" and back to the engine's menu at $0900"
  },
  {
   "address": 16908,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Prints the gymnast's name on the text line and blanks the rest"
  },
  {
   "address": 16945,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The score board's digits start blank, the score in $38 at $45 (6.9)"
  },
  {
   "address": 17006,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Waits for the fire button to be let go, then for it to be held eight frames (\"get set\"): the gymnast takes the set pose; letting go starts the run"
  },
  {
   "address": 17088,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The run-up: the run's frames ($02-$0E) a step every three frames, X up three a step, footsteps at frames 7 and 13; the track rises and falls under the gymnast at X $59 and $98. Pressing fire again from X $7E jumps for the springboard; reaching X $B5 first is a miss"
  },
  {
   "address": 17220,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "A miss: the gymnast stops; miss_count counts it and the button starts again"
  },
  {
   "address": 17260,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The hurdle onto the springboard: from X $3C-$5F the board is met at Y $AF, otherwise at $B1, too low. The gymnast rises and comes down onto it"
  },
  {
   "address": 17369,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The board's Y the hurdle comes down to: $AF for a good take-off, $B1 for a poor one"
  },
  {
   "address": 17382,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "On the board: X moves on ten; landing outside X $78-$91 is a miss. Otherwise the spring: the height reached ($1C) is $99 plus a quarter of how far short of $92 the board was met; a stick pushed left or right gives the half twist (frames from $7B, one more for the difficulty)"
  },
  {
   "address": 17515,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The flight speed's base, $C4, or $BC with the twist"
  },
  {
   "address": 17524,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The flight to the horse: rises with the frames until the hands reach it"
  },
  {
   "address": 17566,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Waits a frame, leaving for the push-off at once when fire is pressed"
  },
  {
   "address": 17598,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "On the horse: the hands sound, then the body turns over the hands a frame at a time, down and then up again, waiting for the fire button"
  },
  {
   "address": 17672,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The frame at which the body has come down onto the hands, set when the hands reach the horse"
  },
  {
   "address": 17705,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The frame at which the body has come back up off the hands"
  },
  {
   "address": 17708,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The push: the frames the body had turned before fire was pressed ($37) take X back by push_table, so the earlier press in the turn moves the gymnast less far back. The flight frames start from there: twisted ($22) or not"
  },
  {
   "address": 17788,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The flight: Y rises a pixel each time the gravity count (gravity_table by height) runs out, until the apex at $1C, then falls, by rewriting four DEC instructions as INC. Each step the stick is read"
  },
  {
   "address": 17853,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Stick up: the tuck, its frames $1C on and a quarter of the frames per turn; stick centred again: back to the layout, four times slower"
  },
  {
   "address": 17940,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Turns a frame; passing frames $2B, $47, $96 and $B2 (each half turn in each position) adds one to the difficulty"
  },
  {
   "address": 17967,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Between turns, the drift forward on odd gravity counts"
  },
  {
   "address": 17985,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Stick down: the landing pose, its own frames, turning slowly; letting go returns to the turn"
  },
  {
   "address": 18132,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "A landing leaning forward: a tenth off, then 31 frames to push the stick back (bit 3) to stand up; otherwise 1.5 back and then the fall's 3.0 off"
  },
  {
   "address": 18142,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "A landing leaning back: a tenth off, the stick forward (bit 2) to recover; otherwise 1.5 back and the fall"
  },
  {
   "address": 18279,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Recovered from the lean: the arms-up pose"
  },
  {
   "address": 18301,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "A clean landing: the gymnast settles to the mat; a stick pushed either way in the next 31 frames tips the landing into a lean"
  },
  {
   "address": 18385,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The arms-up finish, the score and the crowd"
  },
  {
   "address": 18440,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "A fall: the body lands at its angle, 3.0 off the score ($1E tenths from $38), a thud"
  },
  {
   "address": 18504,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The gymnast walks off to the right, footsteps, then the next vault"
  },
  {
   "address": 18589,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "One gravity step of the flight in the layout or tuck, with the landing test: on reaching the mat (Y $C2) at an angle land_height says is too low, a fall"
  },
  {
   "address": 18596,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The DEC, rewritten to INC at the apex, that moves Y up and then down (layout and tuck)"
  },
  {
   "address": 18620,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The DEC or INC (rewritten) of the gravity index in the layout and tuck; then the next count and the landing test"
  },
  {
   "address": 18672,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "One gravity step in the landing pose: on the mat the body's angle sorts the landing: forward lean, clean, back lean, or past them a fall"
  },
  {
   "address": 18676,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The same DEC or INC of Y in the landing pose"
  },
  {
   "address": 18700,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The DEC or INC (rewritten) that steps the gravity count's index in the landing pose; then the next count, and the landing test on the mat by the body's angle"
  },
  {
   "address": 18804,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The miss sound; the second miss in a turn ends it with no score"
  },
  {
   "address": 18849,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The first miss: the score board shows dashes"
  },
  {
   "address": 18861,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Draws a score digit four cells wide into the bitmap's score board from big_digit_l and big_digit_r: digit X at position Y"
  },
  {
   "address": 18960,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Puts the gymnast standing on the mat, facing the way of the vault"
  },
  {
   "address": 18994,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Moves the body down $16 and on $20 for the mat"
  },
  {
   "address": 19017,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "A footstep: voice 1 noise"
  },
  {
   "address": 19057,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The springboard's twang: voice 2"
  },
  {
   "address": 19092,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The miss buzzer: voice 3, held 16 frames twice"
  },
  {
   "address": 19142,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The hands on the horse: voice 2"
  },
  {
   "address": 19177,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The crowd: two noise voices swelling, longer for a score of 10.0 or more"
  },
  {
   "address": 19298,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The fall's thud"
  },
  {
   "address": 19378,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The score in tenths at $38: less the frames spent in the landing pose ($25), plus 0.8 for each half turn and twist ($22), less twice how far the spring's height fell short ($1C - $9F), at least 0; shown in the big digits as d.d, or 10.0 and more with a \"1\""
  },
  {
   "address": 19483,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Adds the two vaults and writes the total into the player's record: three score bytes and the text \"dd.d\"; waits for fire"
  },
  {
   "address": 19588,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Turns the score into text \"dd.d\" at $10-$13 and prints it on the text line"
  },
  {
   "address": 19673,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Waits X frames, by the raster lines at $2A and $33"
  },
  {
   "address": 19691,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Moves the animation frame on by A; past the end of the loop ($4CF8) it goes back to the start ($4CFC). Then X moves on by the speed ($4D08)"
  },
  {
   "address": 19704,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The frame after the loop's last"
  },
  {
   "address": 19708,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The first frame of the animation loop"
  },
  {
   "address": 19716,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Adds the speed to the gymnast's X, nine bits"
  },
  {
   "address": 19720,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The run speed, X's step per frame: 3 on the run, set again for the flight"
  },
  {
   "address": 19735,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Mirrors the unpacked shape at $3B left to right, through bit_reverse"
  },
  {
   "address": 19764,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Stores the unpacked shape upside down into the sprite buffer"
  },
  {
   "address": 19771,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The buffer's low byte in flip_store's first store"
  },
  {
   "address": 19772,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The buffer's high byte in flip_store's first store"
  },
  {
   "address": 19777,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The buffer's low byte in flip_store's second store"
  },
  {
   "address": 19778,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The buffer's high byte in flip_store's second store"
  },
  {
   "address": 19783,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The buffer's low byte in flip_store's third store"
  },
  {
   "address": 19784,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The buffer's high byte in flip_store's third store"
  },
  {
   "address": 19794,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Draws animation frame $1F/$20: each frame has 20 bytes in frame_table, six shapes and a flags byte. Each shape is unpacked (a count of leading zero bytes, then the rest) into $3B and copied into the back buffer ($C400 or $C600), mirrored or flipped as the flags say; then places the sprites"
  },
  {
   "address": 19874,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The next shape of the frame"
  },
  {
   "address": 20035,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The low byte of the buffer address the shape is copied to"
  },
  {
   "address": 20036,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The sprite buffer's high byte for the shape being copied ($C4 or $C6)"
  },
  {
   "address": 20048,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Waits for line $34, then sets the six sprites' X and Y from the frame's offsets around the gymnast's X and Y, with the high X bits, and flips the pointers to the buffer just drawn"
  },
  {
   "address": 20218,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The raster interrupt: alternates lines $F2 and $FB, turning multicolour off for the text line and on again above it"
  },
  {
   "address": 20264,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Prints character A on the text line at column X: copies its eight bytes from the character ROM into the bitmap's last row, with the ROM switched in"
  },
  {
   "address": 20337,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Each byte with its bits reversed, for mirror_rows"
  },
  {
   "address": 20593,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "\"      SCORE:\""
  },
  {
   "address": 20605,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "\"TOTAL SCORE:\""
  },
  {
